WEBVTT

1
00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:21.811
《深水》

2
00:01:49.523 --> 00:01:51.947
带我去月球遨游
Fly me to the moon

3
00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:53.671
让我尽情嬉戏
And let me play

4
00:01:53.671 --> 00:01:55.559
在繁星之间穿梭
among the stars

5
00:01:57.531 --> 00:02:00.117
让我瞧瞧春日的模样
Let me see what spring is like

6
00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.589
在木星与火星之上
On Jupiter and Mars

7
00:02:04.688 --> 00:02:06.638
换言之
In other words

8
00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:10.572
请对我真心
please be true

9
00:02:12.339 --> 00:02:21.345
换言之 我爱你
In other words, I love you

10
00:02:21.345 --> 00:02:22.357
你 你 还有你
You, you, and you

11
00:02:22.495 --> 00:02:23.902
我们仨
The three of us

12
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:25.153
大家给里奇捧个场
Let's give it up for Rich

13
00:02:25.153 --> 00:02:26.499
这招永远经典
That one never gets old

14
00:02:26.499 --> 00:02:33.222
他是在跟我说话 没理你 唱得好啊 机长 太赞了 你可真够呛
He's talking to me, not you. Beautiful voice, Captain. So good. You are terrible.

15
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.708
你知道我最不擅长什么吗？结婚这事儿
You know what I'm terrible at? Marriage.

16
00:02:36.846 --> 00:02:38.912
初次约会我倒挺在行
I'm pretty good at first dates.

17
00:03:07.221 --> 00:03:09.277
嘿 宝贝 我……哦 老天保佑
Hey honey, I, oh thank God.

18
00:03:09.577 --> 00:03:10.431
我还以为赶不上见你了
I thought we missed you.

19
00:03:11.156 --> 00:03:12.511
我收到你的信息了
I got your message.

20
00:03:12.861 --> 00:03:14.536
对 他们改了排班
Yeah, they changed the roster.

21
00:03:15.643 --> 00:03:16.747
你什么时候回来？
When are you coming back?

22
00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:21.633
亲爱的 我拿到新班表就发给你 本
Babe, I'll send you a new schedule when I get it. Ben.

23
00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:23.051
我知道你很难过
I know you're hurting.

24
00:03:23.401 --> 00:03:24.587
我们都一样
We both are.

25
00:03:24.887 --> 00:03:25.843
但你不能总
But you can't keep

26
00:03:25.843 --> 00:03:28.551
逃避现实 等等 亲爱的
running away from that. Hold on, babe.

27
00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:31.932
嘿 丽莎 有消息了吗？
Hey Lisa, you found me something?

28
00:03:32.073 --> 00:03:33.282
有条洛杉矶到上海的航线
There's an LA Shanghai route.

29
00:03:33.282 --> 00:03:34.111
但我不太确定
But I don't know,

30
00:03:34.111 --> 00:03:34.664
很快就要起飞了
it's leaving soon.

31
00:03:34.664 --> 00:03:36.039
行 我接了
All right, I'll take it.

32
00:03:36.181 --> 00:03:37.062
你没时间回家了
You won't have time to go home.

33
00:03:37.062 --> 00:03:38.455
无所谓 我接了
Doesn't matter, I'll take it.

34
00:03:39.186 --> 00:03:40.806
嘿 纳丁打进来了
Hey, I got Nadine on the other line.

35
00:03:40.806 --> 00:03:41.906
我待会儿打给你 行吗？
I'll call you back, all right?

36
00:03:47.505 --> 00:03:49.470
宝贝 妈 你们在哪儿呢？
Honey, Mom, where are you?

37
00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:49.884
儿子病了
Our son is sick.

38
00:03:49.884 --> 00:03:51.492
本 他现在需要你
Ben, he needs you here.

39
00:03:51.737 --> 00:03:54.782
噢 我得走了 妈妈 娜丁 肖恩在喊我
Oh, I gotta go. Mom, Nadine, Sean's calling.

40
00:03:58.506 --> 00:04:02.858
导演 雷尼·哈林

41
00:04:15.013 --> 00:04:17.287
先生 这儿禁止吸烟
Sir, you can't smoke here.

42
00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:22.809
电影院、飞机、酒吧 在我连在外面抽根烟都要被这些扫兴的家伙骚扰
Cinemas, planes, bars. Now I can't even smoke outside without being harassed by the fun police.

43
00:04:22.809 --> 00:04:24.194
拜托啊 先生
Come on, sir.

44
00:04:24.194 --> 00:04:26.226
吸烟区就在那边
The designated smoking areas are located right over there.

45
00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:45.935
上帝啊
god.

46
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.241
嘿 里奇
Hey, Rich.

47
00:04:56.597 --> 00:04:59.090
看来我是你飞上海的副驾驶 好久不见
It looks like I'm your right seat to Shanghai. Been a while.

48
00:04:59.229 --> 00:05:01.763
听说你要退休了 谢了 给你 佩妮
I heard you're hanging it up. Thank you. Here you go, Penny.

49
00:05:01.991 --> 00:05:04.372
嘿 昨晚唱K你没来啊
Hey, you missed karaoke night.

50
00:05:04.511 --> 00:05:12.290
听说你又唱了那首老歌 靠 管用吗？每次都管用 谢了
I hear you sang that same song again. Damn. Did it work? It always works. Thank you.

51
00:05:13.025 --> 00:05:14.966
抱歉 先生 请这边走
Sorry, sir. Please step this way.

52
00:05:15.107 --> 00:05:18.103
该死 我这儿还有个随机的
Hell, I've got a random

53
00:05:18.266 --> 00:05:19.790
登机口见
Meet you guys at the gate

54
00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:23.702
请便 请便 你好吗 佩妮？挺好的 你呢？
Go ahead. Go ahead. How you doing, Penny? Good. How are you?

55
00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.670
你信任我来驾驶这架飞机吗？
You trust me to captain a plane?

56
00:05:25.889 --> 00:05:27.545
你是在担心我的机长资质吗？
You worried about my test phase?

57
00:05:28.569 --> 00:05:31.978
先生 包里有没有电池或者充电宝？
Any batteries or power banks, sir?

58
00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.212
呃 没有 真的不能给我升个舱吗？
Uh, no. Sure I can't get upgraded?

59
00:05:36.539 --> 00:05:38.107
我可是金卡会员 你知道吧
I'm a gold member, you know.

60
00:05:44.689 --> 00:05:48.136
我不想坐 你知道我一坐飞机就紧张
I don't want to. You know how I get with flying.

61
00:05:48.441 --> 00:05:50.063
行 听着 我们非得在这儿说这个吗？
Okay, look, do we have to do this here?

62
00:05:50.063 --> 00:05:52.063
我不想说 就在这儿说 我告诉你：你根本不明白
I don't want to. Right here. Tell you what: You don't get it.

63
00:05:52.282 --> 00:05:54.767
去上海的飞机更大 不对 才没有
The plane is bigger to Shanghai. No, they're not.

64
00:05:54.906 --> 00:05:56.400
比你以前坐过的都大 行吧 那也算个好消息 对吧？
Than the ones you've previously been on. Okay. That's something, right?

65
00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.981
你们没事吧？嗯 没事
You folks okay? Yeah, it's fine.

66
00:05:59.226 --> 00:06:00.821
我女儿害怕坐飞机
My daughter doesn't like flying.

67
00:06:01.153 --> 00:06:03.359
你知道有什么比坐飞机更危险吗？
You know what's more dangerous than flying on an airplane?

68
00:06:05.634 --> 00:06:06.462
河马
Hippos.

69
00:06:07.505 --> 00:06:10.342
骗人 你瞎编的吧 自己上网查
No way. You made that up. Google it.

70
00:06:11.854 --> 00:06:15.575
你会没事的 除非有人偷偷带了一头河马上来
You're gonna be fine. Unless someone smuggles a hippo onboard.

71
00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.477
你是机长吗？
Are you like a captain

72
00:06:19.965 --> 00:06:21.689
不 我是副驾驶
No, I'm a first officer

73
00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.674
我的职责就是保证机长飞行路线笔直
It's my job to make sure the captain flies straight

74
00:06:26.316 --> 00:06:31.149
都这把年纪了还不是机长 科拉  不觉得尴尬吗？够呛吧？的确
Aren't you too old not to be a captain, Cora? Tough, huh? Yeah.

75
00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:35.428
嗯 科拉 人生嘛 有时候
Well, Cora, sometimes in life

76
00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:40.377
总得绕几条弯路 才能抵达想去的地方
you gotta take a few detours to get where you're going

77
00:06:41.193 --> 00:06:44.610
你走过弯路吗？没有 我极度守时
You ever had to take a detour? No, I'm extremely punctual.

78
00:06:46.164 --> 00:06:47.165
乖女孩
Good girl.

79
00:06:48.754 --> 00:06:52.678
她很硬气 我知道 谢了 科拉 科拉 科拉 科拉 快看
She's tough. I know. Thank you, Cora. Cora, Cora, Cora, look.

80
00:06:52.913 --> 00:06:55.758
快看妈妈给我买了啥 嘿 大家快看快看
Look what Mama got me. Hey guys, look, look.

81
00:06:55.898 --> 00:06:58.555
那玩意儿就不能小声点吗？就是 够酷吧？
Could that thing be any louder? I know. Cool, right?

82
00:06:58.694 --> 00:07:00.414
我还给它换了个新电池
And I got a new battery for this.

83
00:07:02.594 --> 00:07:05.353
好了 搞定 给他脖子上植个宠物芯片就行
Okay, there we go. Just put a pet chip in his neck.

84
00:07:07.493 --> 00:07:08.784
科拉 你介意吗？
Cora, do you mind?

85
00:07:09.705 --> 00:07:14.880
我正忙着呢 待会儿还你 别急 密码是他生日
I was doing something. I'll give it back. Just hang on. The password's his birthday.

86
00:07:18.196 --> 00:07:23.443
听着 科拉宝贝 这趟旅行你得看好你弟弟 行吧？是继弟
Listen, Cora honey, we're gonna need you to look out for your brother on this trip, okay? Stepbrother.

87
00:07:30.035 --> 00:07:31.862
好了 就这些了 这是最后一件
That's it. That's the last of this.

88
00:07:35.572 --> 00:07:36.508
装载完毕
Load it up

89
00:07:41.115 --> 00:07:48.047
谢谢 东北航空140次航班 飞往上海 现在开始登机 嘿 嘿
Thank you. Northeastern Airlines Flight 140 to Shanghai will now begin boarding. Hey hey.

90
00:07:48.191 --> 00:07:49.847
哥们儿 千万别吐我一身
Don't you dare puke on me, bro.

91
00:07:49.986 --> 00:07:53.050
信不信我把你扔这儿 我可没开玩笑
I'll drop your drunk ass right here. I'm not playing.

92
00:07:56.475 --> 00:07:57.994
天哪 电竞
Oh gosh. Esports

93
00:07:57.994 --> 00:08:00.238
打游戏也算运动？
Playing video games isn't a real sport.

94
00:08:00.376 --> 00:08:04.425
不就是一群loser宅在妈妈家地下室 嚼着薯片……
It's a bunch of losers kicking it in Mommy's basement with bags of Doritos and...

95
00:08:04.425 --> 00:08:08.354
哦 抱歉 借过一下 哟 电竞小子？松手
Oh, I'm sorry. Excuse me. Ooh. What's up, Esports? Let go.

96
00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:11.004
把你的脏手拿开！哇哦 行 抱歉
Get your hands off her. Whoa. Okay. Sorry.

97
00:08:11.004 --> 00:08:16.117
他只是喝高了 哟 这小妞够劲儿 我喜欢 别碰她
He's just a little drunk. Ooh. She's feisty. I like it. Don't touch her.

98
00:08:16.806 --> 00:08:20.154
你想怎么着啊 键盘侠？
What are you gonna do about it, Captain Keyboard?

99
00:08:20.292 --> 00:08:22.776
哈奇 你这个没教养的蠢货给我放尊重点
Hutch, get your disrespectful dumbass in line.

100
00:08:22.916 --> 00:08:25.122
这是对女士说话的态度吗？教练 交给我 闭嘴 杰西
Is this how we talk to a lady? Coach, I got this. Shut up, Jesse.

101
00:08:25.263 --> 00:08:29.508
在我的队伍里 我们不能这么丢人 抱歉 女士
Now, this is not how we represent ourselves on my team. My apologies, miss.

102
00:08:40.209 --> 00:08:43.141
借过一下 我本来该升舱的
Excuse you. I should have been upgraded.

103
00:09:08.099 --> 00:09:09.513
再循环风扇已经报修了
Recirc fan is written up.

104
00:09:09.903 --> 00:09:11.723
按规定 修好前我们不能起飞
We can't legally depart until they fix it.

105
00:09:14.509 --> 00:09:15.656
我刚重启过了
I just reset it.

106
00:09:17.004 --> 00:09:21.077
保不齐它一会儿又挂了 嗨 欢迎登机 就在右边
Doesn't mean it won't crap out again later. Hi. Welcome. Just to the right.

107
00:09:21.215 --> 00:09:22.629
你让我们好等啊
You made us wait long enough.

108
00:09:23.839 --> 00:09:26.114
咋了 哥们儿？行 好嘞 走你
What's up, bro? Yeah, okay. There we go.

109
00:09:27.221 --> 00:09:29.741
没错 就在这儿 嘿 我挺好的
Yeah. Here you can. Hey, I'm fine.

110
00:09:36.723 --> 00:09:39.093
来 咱们坐下吧 快点儿 坐下
Let's sit down. Come on. Let's sit down.

111
00:09:39.233 --> 00:09:40.698
要不要系好安全带？
You want to strap in?

112
00:09:41.132 --> 00:09:46.415
各位乘客下午好 我是佩妮 代表东北航空欢迎您登机
Good afternoon, passengers. My name is Penny, and on behalf of Northeastern Airlines, I'd like to welcome you aboard.

113
00:09:46.415 --> 00:09:47.333
麻烦让一让 借过一下
Coming through. Excuse us.

114
00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:50.415
别因为我们打断了你们 抱歉 当我们没来过
And don't let us interrupt. Sorry. We were never here.

115
00:09:50.555 --> 00:09:52.414
先生 麻烦您把座椅靠背调直
Sir, would you please put your seat back up?

116
00:09:52.557 --> 00:09:56.043
当然没问题 欢迎乘坐N140航班 本航班从洛杉矶起飞
Why sure. I would like to welcome you aboard Flight N 140.  Departing from LAX.

117
00:09:56.043 --> 00:10:00.249
目的地是上海 谢谢 我们即将开始起飞程序
And arriving at Shanghai. Thank you. We'll be beginning our departure procedures shortly.

118
00:10:00.398 --> 00:10:01.001
现在
So at this time,

119
00:10:01.001 --> 00:10:01.809
请就座
please take your seats

120
00:10:01.809 --> 00:10:03.902
并确认您的安全带已经系好
and make sure your seat belts are securely fastened.

121
00:10:09.539 --> 00:10:11.657
东北航空140 本航班将从
Northeastern 140, you will depart today

122
00:10:11.657 --> 00:10:12.393
24左跑道起飞
from runway 24L.

123
00:10:12.646 --> 00:10:17.061
起飞前检查单：襟翼 你觉得现在设定在几度？
Before Takeoff Checklist Flaps. Where do you think they're set?

124
00:10:18.963 --> 00:10:21.652
我需要你回答 本 你明明知道
I just need a response. You do know, Ben,

125
00:10:21.793 --> 00:10:24.615
美国联邦航空局规定  我们必须反复确认襟翼
that the FAA has us confirm flaps over and over

126
00:10:24.762 --> 00:10:27.210
就因为达美1141航班上那帮蠢货
only because those idiots flying Delta 1141

127
00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.038
光顾着聊想泡哪个空姐
were so busy yakking about which flight attendant they wanted to bang

128
00:10:30.181 --> 00:10:32.044
结果忘了检查 机长
they forgot to check them. Captain,

129
00:10:32.044 --> 00:10:35.563
给个话就行 襟翼五度 本
I just need a response. Flaps are five, Ben.

130
00:10:35.704 --> 00:10:38.036
和之前三次检查的位置一样
Same place as the last three times we checked them.

131
00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.628
东北140 允许24左跑道起飞
Northeastern 140, you are cleared for takeoff 24 L.

132
00:10:44.118 --> 00:10:46.511
允许24左起飞 东北140
Clear for takeoff 24 left, Northeastern 140.

133
00:11:15.502 --> 00:11:16.882
再见 机长
See you guys, Captain.

134
00:11:21.704 --> 00:11:24.474
刚才那会儿 你因为检查襟翼的事 是不是想揍我？
It looked like you wanted to take a swing at me over that flap check.

135
00:11:26.409 --> 00:11:28.513
那对我的仕途可没好处
That wouldn't help my career any.

136
00:11:28.653 --> 00:11:30.854
你不就是这么被空军踢出来的？
Isn't that how you got bounced out of the Air Force?

137
00:11:31.967 --> 00:11:34.137
哼 那个高级长官是自作自受
Well, that senior officer had it coming

138
00:11:35.211 --> 00:11:37.604
而你 你就是招人烦
You, you're just annoying

139
00:11:37.973 --> 00:11:40.402
丢了你的退休金和补贴
Blew your pension and your benefits

140
00:11:40.803 --> 00:11:43.865
有老婆孩子要养 日子不好过啊
That's tough with a wife and young kids

141
00:11:44.324 --> 00:11:47.327
只能来了一家破通勤航空公司混口饭吃
Had to catch on with some shitbag commuter airline

142
00:11:47.465 --> 00:11:48.732
现在你却坐在了我的位子上
and now you're in that seat

143
00:11:49.059 --> 00:11:50.709
这本该是我的位置才对
when of course you should be in mine

144
00:11:50.848 --> 00:11:55.499
心里想着自己可不能再犯错了 呵 本 Nand thinking you can't afford to break any more rules. Well, Ben

145
00:11:57.647 --> 00:11:59.232
我肯定不会说出去的
I'm sure not gonna tell.

146
00:12:02.445 --> 00:12:04.665
刚才我揍你一顿 也没人能拿我怎样
So I could have popped you one and gotten away with it

147
00:12:07.822 --> 00:12:10.099
我会告发你的 我就知道你会
I'd rat you out. I know you would.

148
00:12:17.684 --> 00:12:19.117
不加冰 嗯
No ice. Mmm hmm.

149
00:12:36.657 --> 00:12:37.307
怎么了？
What's up?

150
00:12:38.472 --> 00:12:39.113
没啥
Not a lot.

151
00:12:42.658 --> 00:12:45.418
我孙女住上海
My granddaughter lives in Shanghai.

152
00:12:47.042 --> 00:12:47.711
真不错
Awesome.

153
00:13:11.756 --> 00:13:15.786
就是想问问你儿子最近怎么样
I just wanted to check in on how your son's doing.

154
00:13:17.164 --> 00:13:18.795
听说他最近病得不轻
Heard he's been pretty sick lately

155
00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:23.765
你妻子肯定很辛苦
Must be tough on your wife

156
00:13:23.906 --> 00:13:26.269
尤其你还要上班 顾不上家里
especially when you're working and all

157
00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:28.807
嗯 纳丁的家人就住在附近
Yeah well Nadine's family lives nearby

158
00:13:30.731 --> 00:13:32.039
我不在的时候 他们会帮忙照应
They help out when I'm gone

159
00:13:35.504 --> 00:13:36.470
什么鬼
What the fuck

160
00:13:56.249 --> 00:14:02.841
哦 见鬼 数据表明 气流颠簸从未导致过飞机失事
Oh damn it. Statistics say that turbulence has never brought a plane down.

161
00:14:04.148 --> 00:14:06.295
这算是安慰吗？我没事
Is that supposed to be comforting? I'm fine.

162
00:14:06.295 --> 00:14:09.673
我正需要这杯酒提神呢 结果全洒了
I just spilled my gin and tonic when I really need it most.

163
00:14:18.103 --> 00:14:26.285
先生您好 嘿 猜猜我需要什么 抱歉 耳塞没了 完美 真是完美
Hi sir. Hey, take a guess what I need. I'm sorry. We're out of earplugs. That's perfect. Just perfect.

164
00:14:26.539 --> 00:14:31.213
怎么 卫生纸也要限量供应了是吧？你们可真行
What, you're gonna ration out the toilet paper too, huh? You guys are unbelievable.

165
00:14:32.074 --> 00:14:34.318
先生 您不能这么做
Sir, you can't do that.

166
00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.525
我听不见
I can't hear you.

167
00:14:39.361 --> 00:14:39.848
嗯
Yeah.

168
00:14:52.857 --> 00:15:01.570
什么？你配不上她 哦不 我不是那个意思 等等 真的？她可是个绝佳的大美女
What? Way out of your league. Oh no. No, I wasn't. Wait. Really? She's a solid nine.

169
00:15:02.211 --> 00:15:04.773
不想打击你 但你顶多五分
Hate to break it to you, but you're a five.

170
00:15:05.387 --> 00:15:09.941
收拾收拾也许能到六分 这已经算给你面子了
Maybe you could scrub up to a six but that's being generous

171
00:15:10.963 --> 00:15:15.242
哦 我快被后面的贝齐·罗打败了
Oh I'm getting destroyed by Betsy Ross back here

172
00:15:15.906 --> 00:15:19.193
等等 万一我性格超好呢？就你？
Wait what if I've got a great personality You don't

173
00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:21.355
哦
Oh

174
00:17:18.106 --> 00:17:23.755
科拉 亲爱的 听着 我知道改变很可怕 好吗？
Cora honey Look I know change is scary okay

175
00:17:24.388 --> 00:17:26.382
但芬恩真的很崇拜你
But Finn really looks up to you

176
00:17:27.011 --> 00:17:30.210
所以你稍微和善一点会死吗？
So would it kill you to be just a little nicer

177
00:18:10.468 --> 00:18:11.398
嘿 是我
Hey it's me

178
00:19:14.843 --> 00:19:15.479
科拉
Cora

179
00:19:18.373 --> 00:19:21.226
爸妈呢 他们去泳池游泳了
Where's Mom and Dad They went to the pool for a swim

180
00:19:21.367 --> 00:19:23.193
飞机上还有游泳池
There's a pool on the plane

181
00:19:23.334 --> 00:19:25.448
对 对 就在后面
Yeah Yeah it's back there

182
00:20:05.376 --> 00:20:07.268
嘿 小朋友 找不到座位吗
Hey little man can't you find your seat

183
00:20:08.862 --> 00:20:10.523
哦 你喜欢玩游戏啊
Oh you into gaming huh

184
00:20:11.002 --> 00:20:12.925
没错 要不要给我露一手
Right You wanna show me how it's done

185
00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:17.322
好 来吧 坐这里 好的
Yeah Come on Here Okay

186
00:20:17.322 --> 00:20:19.004
你的右手放这儿
Your right hand is right here

187
00:20:34.509 --> 00:20:38.478
取消前部货舱火警主警告 确认 收到
I am canceling master warning for forward cargo fire. Confirm. Confirmed.

188
00:20:38.616 --> 00:20:40.997
执行记忆项目 前部货舱火警 明白
Let's do the memory items, forward cargo fire. Copy that.

189
00:20:41.307 --> 00:20:45.933
前货舱灭火开关打开 确认 已确认 释放灭火瓶 确认 已确认
Forward cargo fire switch on. Confirm. Confirmed. Fire bottle discharge on. Confirm. Confirmed.

190
00:20:59.637 --> 00:21:01.291
Pan-pan-pan 东北航空140
Pan-pan-pan, Northeastern 140.

191
00:21:01.432 --> 00:21:04.607
我们前货舱火警警报 并检测到烟雾
We have a fire indication in our forward cargo bay and smoke has been detected.

192
00:21:04.746 --> 00:21:07.075
请告知最近合适机场的航向
We require a heading to the nearest suitable airport.

193
00:21:08.056 --> 00:21:11.014
东北航空140 这里是奥克兰空管中心
Northeastern 140, Northeastern 140, this is KZAK Oakland.

194
00:21:11.014 --> 00:21:13.069
最近的机场是关岛国际机场
Your nearest airport is Guam International.

195
00:21:13.069 --> 00:21:14.462
在你们南边400海里
400 nautical miles south.

196
00:21:15.343 --> 00:21:18.861
叫机长回来 收到 收到 奥克兰 东北航空140
Let's get the captain back here. Roger. Roger. KZAK, Northeastern 140.

197
00:21:19.001 --> 00:21:22.278
我们现在直飞关岛 正在下降到一万英尺 东北航空140
We are now direct Guam, descending at 10,000 feet. Northeastern 140.

198
00:21:28.494 --> 00:21:30.429
你还好吗 亲爱的？嗯 我没事
You okay honey? Yeah, I'm fine.

199
00:21:34.741 --> 00:21:37.175
本 现在什么情况？前货舱着火了
Ben, what do we have here? Forward cargo fire.

200
00:21:37.943 --> 00:21:42.057
记忆项目已执行 灭火瓶没反应 我已宣布紧急状态
We've completed the memory items. Fire bottles aren't discharging. I've declared an emergency.

201
00:21:42.197 --> 00:21:44.473
我们正在下降到一万英尺 转向关岛国际机场
We're descending to 10,000, redirecting to Guam International.

202
00:21:45.373 --> 00:21:47.613
下去 把火灭了
Get down there. Put it out.

203
00:21:48.237 --> 00:21:48.832
收到
Roger.

204
00:22:14.235 --> 00:22:14.673
爸
Dad.

205
00:22:17.197 --> 00:22:19.922
爸 你在里面吗？
Dad, are you in there?

206
00:22:52.094 --> 00:22:53.750
火焰瞬间演变成了爆炸
The fire turned into an explosion.

207
00:23:03.312 --> 00:23:04.347
搞什么鬼？
What the hell?

208
00:23:16.325 --> 00:23:20.778
客舱失火了 情况越来越糟 准备迫降
We lost the cabin. This isn't getting any better. Taking her down.

209
00:23:27.544 --> 00:23:29.200
快 快 抓住面罩
Come on, come on, grab them.

210
00:23:29.338 --> 00:23:30.443
快戴上
Put it on, come on.

211
00:23:37.692 --> 00:23:39.140
把这个戴上 好的
Put this on. Okay.

212
00:23:43.076 --> 00:23:44.181
里奇 快戴面罩
Rich, put your mask on.

213
00:23:44.319 --> 00:23:49.219
本 等你戴好 我们都飞到一万英尺平飞了 佐伊 戴面罩
Ben, we're gonna be level at 10,000 before you can even get that on. Zoe, get your mask.

214
00:24:06.893 --> 00:24:09.895
一万一千 目标一万 还剩一千
11,000 for 10,000. Thousand to go.

215
00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:14.333
高度一万 到达一万英尺
Level 10,000. I see 10,000.

216
00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:28.915
飞机稳定了 仪表正常 接管飞机 我要广播了 我接手 确认
We're stable. Instruments responsive. Take the aircraft. I'm gonna make a PA. My aircraft. Confirmed.

217
00:24:29.778 --> 00:24:31.089
由你操控 确认
Your aircraft. Confirmed.

218
00:24:32.982 --> 00:24:34.612
各位旅客 我是机长
Folks, this is the captain speaking.

219
00:24:35.550 --> 00:24:38.378
货舱起火
We have a fire in the cargo hold.

220
00:24:39.081 --> 00:24:43.905
我们已降至安全高度 正备降关岛国际机场
We've descended to a safe altitude and diverted to Guam International Airport.

221
00:24:44.936 --> 00:24:46.873
请务必保持冷静
It's very important that everybody remain calm.

222
00:24:50.627 --> 00:24:54.328
让一下 让一下 我直接过去
Excuse me, excuse me, I'm coming straight back.

223
00:24:54.509 --> 00:24:56.320
请大家听从乘务员的指示
We need all of you to follow your flight attendant's instructions.

224
00:24:56.460 --> 00:25:00.427
请稍等 我们正在把受影响区域的乘客转移到安全座位
One second as we get passengers near the affected area moved to safer seating.

225
00:25:00.731 --> 00:25:04.013
丽莎 后面还有空位
Lisa, there are more seats at the back.

226
00:25:05.020 --> 00:25:06.570
先生 这边 快走 快走
This way, sir. Go, go.

227
00:25:06.712 --> 00:25:11.440
别动 除非必须...... 丽莎 清空通道
No, no. Don't move unless you have to. Lisa, clear the passage.

228
00:25:25.213 --> 00:25:28.146
我爸妈 现在不行 待在这儿
My parents. Not now. Stay here.

229
00:25:57.072 --> 00:26:01.420
一号引擎失效了 先生 你不能那样 你担心的是这个
We've lost engine one. Sir, you can't do that. You're worried about this.

230
00:26:01.560 --> 00:26:03.144
立刻回你的座位
Get back to your seat right now.

231
00:26:27.999 --> 00:26:30.380
飞行控制失效 液压系统失灵
Flight controls don't respond. Hydraulics are gone.

232
00:26:30.519 --> 00:26:32.106
别跟我说哪里坏了
Don't tell me what's broken.

233
00:26:32.245 --> 00:26:34.005
告诉我这架飞机上还有什么还能用
Tell me what still works on this jet.

234
00:26:34.144 --> 00:26:38.357
手动缆线还能控制外侧副翼、升降舵和方向舵 动手吧
You have manual cables to the outboard ailerons, elevator, and rudder. Let's get to it.

235
00:26:38.357 --> 00:26:42.743
求救 求救 求救 东北航空140 一号引擎失效 140 关岛国际
Mayday Mayday Mayday Northeastern 140 We lost engine one 140 Guam International

236
00:26:42.743 --> 00:26:43.736
仍是最近的机场
is still the closest option

237
00:26:44.161 --> 00:26:45.611
我们需要找个更近的机场
We need something closer

238
00:26:45.914 --> 00:26:46.922
140 我们没别的了
140 we have nothing

239
00:26:46.922 --> 00:26:48.434
你们在公海上空
You're over open ocean

240
00:26:58.824 --> 00:27:01.032
救救我们
Help us Help

241
00:27:09.869 --> 00:27:12.700
仪表指针全部归零 我们切换到备用仪表
Instrument needles all rolling back to zero We're on standby instruments

242
00:27:12.700 --> 00:27:16.940
求救 求救 求救 这里是东北航空140 我们失去动力
Mayday Mayday Mayday This is Northeastern 140 We've lost power

243
00:27:16.940 --> 00:27:18.286
机长 无线电失灵了
Captain we lost the radio

244
00:27:20.811 --> 00:27:22.777
关掉辅助动力装置  收到
Stop the APU Roger

245
00:27:27.715 --> 00:27:30.127
没事 坚持住 好吗
It's okay Just hold on okay

246
00:27:31.753 --> 00:27:32.561
再试一次
Hit it again

247
00:27:33.824 --> 00:27:36.702
不行 又试了一次 辅助动力装置还是没启动
Nothing Again APU is not coming up

248
00:27:36.702 --> 00:27:37.543
高度6000英尺
We're at 6,000 feet

249
00:27:37.690 --> 00:27:40.935
试试手动释放冲压空气涡轮 冲压空气涡轮 确认
Try manual deployment of RAT Ram Air Turbine Confirmed

250
00:27:49.190 --> 00:27:53.641
冲压空气涡轮启动 仪表恢复 重启发动机
Ram Air Turbine working Instrument's back online Relight the engine

251
00:27:54.776 --> 00:27:55.334
点火
Ignition

252
00:27:56.985 --> 00:27:57.930
再试一次
Hit it again

253
00:28:05.684 --> 00:28:06.309
不
No

254
00:28:08.963 --> 00:28:14.932
爸 你在哪儿 不 不 不 等等 等等 过来 放开我 放开我
Dad, where are you? No, no, no. Wait, wait. Come here. Let me go. Let me go.

255
00:28:16.971 --> 00:28:19.318
我们会没事的 再试试
We'll be all right. Try it again.

256
00:28:22.355 --> 00:28:25.212
不行 空速不够 无法重新点火
It's not working. We don't have enough airspeed to relight.

257
00:28:25.565 --> 00:28:27.635
也没有空间俯冲加速
And no breathing room to dive for more.

258
00:28:30.579 --> 00:28:33.719
我们要弃机了 开始放油
We're gonna ditch. Start dumping the fuel.

259
00:28:33.923 --> 00:28:36.857
放弃重启引擎 快 马上执行！放油！
We're giving up on the relight. Do it. Do it now. Dumping fuel.

260
00:28:40.339 --> 00:28:41.719
各位旅客 我是机长
This is the captain speaking.

261
00:28:41.719 --> 00:28:43.858
做好防冲击姿势！
Brace for impact.

262
00:28:52.316 --> 00:28:55.592
抱紧！低头！别抬头！
Brace, brace. Heads down. Stay down.

263
00:28:56.493 --> 00:28:59.496
抱紧！低头！
Brace, brace. Heads down.

264
00:29:00.808 --> 00:29:02.668
好 趴下！快趴下！
Okay, okay. Get down. Get down.

265
00:29:07.228 --> 00:29:14.494
（毛利语对话）
SPEAKING MAORI

266
00:29:22.243 --> 00:29:26.383
本 每下降一千英尺 报一次高度和空速
Ben, I want altitude and airspeed callouts every thousand feet.

267
00:29:26.523 --> 00:29:28.939
高度3000英尺 空速220 太快了 该死！
3,000 feet, airspeed 220. Too damn fast.

268
00:29:30.431 --> 00:29:33.368
我看到海浪了 得向右转
I have a visual reference to swells. We gotta come right.

269
00:29:35.670 --> 00:29:39.257
里奇 检查单上说平行于海浪就行 浪不算太大
Rich, the checklist says we just parallel with the swells. Swells aren't that bad.

270
00:29:39.545 --> 00:29:42.987
我需要尽可能大的顶风来降低下降速度
I want all the headwind I can get to slow vertical down rate

271
00:29:43.126 --> 00:29:45.196
里奇 要是机翼太低打到水面 飞机会打滚的
Rich, if we go wing low and catch a tip, we're gonna cartwheel

272
00:29:45.335 --> 00:29:47.731
但要是入水速度太快 我们肯定没命
And if I hit the water too fast, we're done for sure

273
00:29:48.165 --> 00:29:54.095
里奇 你就告诉我风往哪边吹浪 转方向！
Just tell me which way the wind is blowing those swells, Rich. Turn the airplane

274
00:29:54.838 --> 00:29:56.925
我们要平行于海浪迫降
We're gonna land parallel to the swells

275
00:29:57.657 --> 00:29:59.967
我们得向右转30度 确认
We gotta come right 30 degrees. Confirm

276
00:30:01.972 --> 00:30:02.629
确认
Confirmed

277
00:30:05.389 --> 00:30:07.805
收到 我这就去处理那个问题 明白
Bug that heading for me. Roger that

278
00:30:09.911 --> 00:30:12.527
2000英尺 空速190 需要放襟翼吗？
2,000 feet. Airspeed 190. You want flaps?

279
00:30:12.527 --> 00:30:14.638
尽可能多地给我 襟翼开到最大
As much as you can give me. Flaps at maximum

280
00:30:17.919 --> 00:30:20.261
1000英尺 空速180 还是太快了
1,000 feet. Airspeed 180. Still too fast

281
00:30:21.785 --> 00:30:22.854
空速170
Airspeed 170

282
00:30:23.787 --> 00:30:26.582
起落架收起 辅助动力装置灭火系统启动
Landing gear up. APU fire suppression

283
00:30:28.394 --> 00:30:31.974
注意机翼 高度300英尺 空速仍为170
Watch your wings. 300 feet. Airspeed still 170

284
00:30:31.974 --> 00:30:35.660
本 把座位调到最靠后 系紧安全带
Ben, move your seat all the way back. Tighten your harness

285
00:30:35.913 --> 00:30:36.983
里奇 保持那侧机翼上扬
Rich, keep that wing up

286
00:30:38.008 --> 00:30:42.598
我将向左偏10度 机尾下降 机尾下降 高度100英尺
I'm gonna bug you left 10 degrees. Tail down. Tail down. 100 feet

287
00:30:47.328 --> 00:30:49.122
来吧 姑娘 配合我一下
Come on, girl. Work with me.

288
00:31:11.559 --> 00:31:13.723
本 把你的座位调到最后面 照做
Ben, move your seat all the way back. Do it.

289
00:31:16.702 --> 00:31:17.944
准备迎接冲击
Brace for impact.

290
00:31:30.012 --> 00:31:31.198
哦 糟糕
Oh, shit.

291
00:32:52.487 --> 00:32:55.214
救命 谁来帮帮我
Help me. Help.

292
00:32:55.870 --> 00:32:57.251
求你了
Please.

293
00:32:58.390 --> 00:33:00.149
来人啊 帮帮忙
Somebody help.

294
00:33:04.258 --> 00:33:09.263
有人吗？救命！
Somebody help.

295
00:33:23.760 --> 00:33:24.510
里奇
Rich.

296
00:33:27.453 --> 00:33:28.419
醒醒 里奇
Wake up, Rich.

297
00:33:29.421 --> 00:33:34.564
你成功了！要不是那片珊瑚礁挡道 咱们现在早开香槟庆祝了
You did it. If it wasn't for that coral reef, we'd be popping champagne right now.

298
00:33:41.950 --> 00:33:43.606
你没事吧？没事
You okay? Yeah.

299
00:33:47.404 --> 00:33:48.111
好的
Okay.

300
00:33:51.865 --> 00:33:53.971
嘿 嘿
Hey. Hey.

301
00:34:22.543 --> 00:34:25.764
你待在这儿别动 我马上回来 好 好
You stay here, okay? And I'll be right back. Okay. Okay.

302
00:34:38.110 --> 00:34:41.562
我的天！里奇 抓住他的胳膊
Oh, my God. Rich, grab him by the arms.

303
00:34:41.700 --> 00:34:42.908
我试试把他弄出来 好
I'll try to get him loose, okay.

304
00:34:44.185 --> 00:34:47.973
一、二、三！不 不 不 停！
One, two, three. No, no, no. Stop.

305
00:34:47.973 --> 00:34:48.876
那样行不通
That's not going to work.

306
00:34:50.122 --> 00:34:52.846
嘿 你会没事的 里奇
Hey, you're gonna be okay, Rich.

307
00:34:52.987 --> 00:34:54.672
我们会把你救出来的
We're gonna get you out of here.

308
00:34:55.110 --> 00:34:59.886
伙计 时间不多了 别紧张 里奇 你的腿被卡住了
Guys, we don't have much time. Easy, Rich. Your leg's pinned.

309
00:35:00.623 --> 00:35:02.306
用斧头砍断 你说什么？
Crash ax. What?

310
00:35:03.825 --> 00:35:04.784
你休想
Don't even think about it.

311
00:35:04.784 --> 00:35:07.585
不 你不能锯我的腿 还没到那一步
No, you're not taking my leg. Not yet.

312
00:35:08.554 --> 00:35:09.794
你可以用它把我撬出来
You can use it to pry me out.

313
00:36:28.572 --> 00:36:29.325
丽莎
Lisa.

314
00:36:30.607 --> 00:36:31.294
丽莎
Lisa.

315
00:36:33.398 --> 00:36:36.470
丽莎 丽莎
Lisa, Lisa.

316
00:36:41.371 --> 00:36:42.269
丽莎
Lisa.

317
00:36:47.860 --> 00:36:48.494
