00:54:01.962 --> 00:54:05.272
要是出事 下面的人全得困在里面
If this thing goes down, anyone who's down there is gonna be stuck inside.

488
00:54:05.468 --> 00:54:07.929
行了 杰西 别犯二了 兄弟
Okay, Jesse, don't be stupid, bro.

489
00:54:08.210 --> 00:54:13.419
那些伤号和老人根本撑不住 杰西 你给我回来 杰西
Some of these wounded and old people won't make it out there, man. Jesse, come back here. Jesse.

490
00:54:16.874 --> 00:54:19.114
走了 快点 快点
Let's go. Come on, come on.

491
00:54:21.188 --> 00:54:26.483
都走 对 都走 走吧 深呼吸
Everyone's going. Yeah, everyone's going. Go for it. Just breathe.

492
00:54:26.917 --> 00:54:29.800
看来那杯伏特加苏打水是喝不上了
Guess you ain't getting me that vodka soda anytime soon.

493
00:55:14.241 --> 00:55:14.787
教练
Coach.

494
00:55:16.796 --> 00:55:24.953
我扶着你 伤着没？丽莎 丽莎 丽莎 丽莎 还有别人吗？教练 教练
I got you. Are you hurt? Lisa, Lisa, Lisa, Lisa. Is there anyone else? Coach, Coach.

495
00:55:31.466 --> 00:55:32.398
教练
Coach.

496
00:55:33.053 --> 00:55:34.259
别 别 别
No, no, no.

497
00:55:35.297 --> 00:55:37.091
抓他 杰西 快抓他
Grab him, Jesse. Grab him.

498
00:55:49.138 --> 00:55:54.867
动起来 动起来 教练 杰西
Move, move. Coach, Jesse.

499
00:55:58.476 --> 00:55:59.188
过来
Come on.

500
00:56:00.633 --> 00:56:01.668
喂 喂 别紧张
Hey, hey. Take it easy.

501
00:56:02.352 --> 00:56:05.342
你 给我下水
You. Get in the water.

502
00:56:05.521 --> 00:56:14.679
别紧张 别紧张 不 住手 下水 不 下去 我不知道 下水 住手 住手
Take it easy. Take it easy. No, stop. Get in the water. No. Get in. I didn't know. Get in the water. Stop it. Stop it.

503
00:56:16.442 --> 00:56:19.233
住手 求你了 住手
Stop it. Stop it, please.

504
00:56:20.860 --> 00:56:22.964
住手 喂 喂
Stop it. Hey, hey.

505
00:56:24.173 --> 00:56:26.301
这样有什么用？啊？
How is this helping? Huh?

506
00:56:27.004 --> 00:56:29.157
你想活命吗？想吗？
Do you want to live? Do you?

507
00:56:32.342 --> 00:56:35.730
是的  想活就给我保持冷静
Yes, then we need to keep our cool.

508
00:56:36.832 --> 00:56:38.250
告诉我 我们能冷静下来
Tell me we're gonna keep our cool.

509
00:56:38.395 --> 00:56:39.590
我会冷静的
I'm gonna keep my cool.

510
00:56:49.461 --> 00:56:52.026
孩子 来点坚果 优质蛋白
Kid, have some nuts. Good protein.

511
00:56:52.167 --> 00:56:53.927
长身体的男孩需要补充蛋白质
Growing boys need their protein.

512
00:56:54.065 --> 00:56:55.718
妈妈说吃坚果会让我长胖
Mommy says nuts make me fat.

513
00:56:55.860 --> 00:56:58.439
哪有母亲会说出这种话？
What kind of a mother would say a thing like that?

514
00:56:59.782 --> 00:57:01.415
行吧 不管那些坚果了
Okay fine. Screw the nuts.

515
00:57:02.280 --> 00:57:03.420
你究竟几岁了？
How old are you anyway?

516
00:57:03.558 --> 00:57:07.594
你觉得我们还剩多少空气？我快八岁了 你才七岁 太危险了
How much air do you think we have left? Almost eight. You're seven. It's too risky.

517
00:57:07.734 --> 00:57:09.354
我猜应该已经学会上厕所了吧
I presume fully potty trained.

518
00:57:09.495 --> 00:57:12.773
怎么 就这么干等着？门还是关着的
What, so just do nothing? The doors stay shut.

519
00:57:12.912 --> 00:57:16.570
你以为我多大？一百岁？也差不多了
How old do you think I am? A hundred? Pretty close.

520
00:57:17.019 --> 00:57:18.717
待在原地 没人能找到我们
Nobody is going to find us if we stay in here.

521
00:57:19.044 --> 00:57:23.529
嘿 干得漂亮啊各位？已经有点闷了 我们可以游出去
Oh, great job guys, huh? It's already getting stuffy. We could swim.

522
00:57:25.156 --> 00:57:28.153
我先下 游下去找出路
I can go first, swim down and find a way out.

523
00:57:28.153 --> 00:57:30.721
不行 有我在 你别去 我来
No. No, not on my watch. I can do it.

524
00:57:30.861 --> 00:57:32.067
我比你熟悉这架飞机
I know the plane better than you

525
00:57:32.207 --> 00:57:33.895
而且你手腕还骨折了
And you have a broken wrist

526
00:57:33.895 --> 00:57:35.932
是你帮我接好的 记得吧？
Which you made better, remember

527
00:57:36.798 --> 00:57:38.419
来 绑上
Here, strap it

528
00:57:40.871 --> 00:57:43.643
快 时间不多了 快
Come on. We don't have much time. Come on.

529
00:57:45.714 --> 00:57:54.186
好 我四处看看 马上回来 行吗？嗯 嗯 行 好
Okay. So I'm gonna take a look around and then I'm gonna be back in a tick, okay? Yeah. Yeah. Okay. Good.

530
00:57:56.542 --> 00:57:57.473
别走
Don't go.

531
00:58:00.200 --> 00:58:04.307
嘿 芬恩 我走了之后 替我照顾好姑娘们 行吗？
Hey, Finn. You look after the ladies for me while I'm gone, yeah?

532
00:58:05.965 --> 00:58:07.897
行 行 没问题
Okay, okay, okay.

533
00:58:13.455 --> 00:58:16.251
早点回来啊 马特
Hurry back, Matt.

534
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:19.627
她居然记得我名字 哈？
She remembered my name, huh?

535
00:58:20.013 --> 00:58:21.495
听着 我感觉咱俩有戏
Look, I've got a good feeling about us.

536
00:59:25.501 --> 00:59:28.363
喂 喂 嘿 这边
Hey, hey. Hey, over here.

537
00:59:29.427 --> 00:59:30.463
救命
Help us.

538
00:59:31.291 --> 00:59:35.604
救命啊 这边 有人需要帮助 救命
Help. Over here. There's people that need help. Help.

539
00:59:38.195 --> 00:59:39.367
我女儿 科拉！
My daughter, Cora.

540
00:59:46.341 --> 00:59:48.239
救命
Help.

541
00:59:52.727 --> 00:59:54.794
救命 这怎么可能发生？
Help. How could this happen?

542
00:59:58.353 --> 00:59:59.454
我们这可是在鸟不拉屎的地方
We're in the middle of nowhere.

543
00:59:59.596 --> 01:00:00.557
你怎么就能从天上掉下来呢？
How do you just fall out of the sky?

544
01:00:00.700 --> 01:00:02.044
他们得多久才能来救我们？
How long till they rescue us?

545
01:00:02.184 --> 01:00:04.385
别跟我耍贫嘴 回答问题
Don't be a smart ass. Just answer the question.

546
01:00:04.531 --> 01:00:08.328
听着 我知道的都告诉你 行了吧？八成是你他妈的搞的鬼
Look, I'll tell you what I know, okay? Probably your fucking fault.

547
01:00:09.021 --> 01:00:10.990
你跟这家破航空公司一个德行
You and this shitty airline.

548
01:00:10.990 --> 01:00:13.091
听着 我知道你很生气 想要个说法
Look, you're angry, you want answers.

549
01:00:13.230 --> 01:00:14.679
我会给你交代的 好吗？
You're gonna get them, okay?

550
01:00:17.089 --> 01:00:19.255
说实话 能活着找人算账 我们已经够幸运了
Truth is, we're lucky to be alive to blame somebody.

551
01:00:21.410 --> 01:00:23.410
这趟航班上有257个人
There were 257 souls on this flight.

552
01:00:25.483 --> 01:00:27.243
我数了数 大约就剩咱们30个了
I count maybe 30 of us.

553
01:00:30.419 --> 01:00:38.739
照我看 咱们就一件事要办 就是回家跟家人团聚 明白吗？我们有救生筏
The way I see it, we have one job to do, and that is to get home to see our families. Okay? We have rafts.

554
01:00:38.739 --> 01:00:40.149
咱们得坐上去
We need to get in them.

555
01:00:40.291 --> 01:00:44.188
谁没救生衣 从座底下拿一件 报上名字 我叫哈奇
If you don't have a life jacket, take one from under a seat. Tell me your name. I'm Hutch.

556
01:00:44.188 --> 01:00:46.761
哈奇 帮忙把第二个救生筏拉出来
Hutch, I need you to pull out that second raft.

557
01:00:46.983 --> 01:00:50.435
大家快来帮哈奇  把救生筏推到水里去
Everybody help Hutch get the raft into the water.

558
01:00:55.671 --> 01:00:57.664
卡住了 卡住了！
It's stuck. It's stuck.

559
01:00:59.828 --> 01:01:01.138
来 抓紧这个
Here, hold on to that.

560
01:01:01.138 --> 01:01:03.372
科拉 你就待在这儿 好吗？
Cora, I need you to stay here, okay?

561
01:01:03.521 --> 01:01:05.662
别靠近边上 懂吗？好
Stay away from the edge, all right? Okay.

562
01:01:05.800 --> 01:01:08.142
我去取点东西 嘿 大家都小心点
I'm gonna go get something. Hey, everybody, be careful.

563
01:01:08.142 --> 01:01:08.935
水流很急 注意安全
The tide is moving fast.

564
01:01:13.014 --> 01:01:14.152
那儿有两个
Two there.

565
01:01:19.814 --> 01:01:21.814
行 开始吧 准备好了没？
All right, here we go. Ready?

566
01:01:29.237 --> 01:01:30.305
我觉得搞定了
I think we got it.

567
01:01:46.254 --> 01:01:47.804
好 准备好了没？准备好了没？
All right, ready? Ready?

568
01:01:50.361 --> 01:01:51.362
爸爸！
Daddy!

569
01:01:53.201 --> 01:01:54.590
爸爸！
Daddy!

570
01:02:05.100 --> 01:02:08.769
嘿 回来！这个必须带上 快走 快走 走！走！快快快！走啊！
Hey, come back! We need this. Let's go, let's go. Go! Go! Go, go, go! Let's go!

571
01:02:08.769 --> 01:02:14.358
快离开这儿 谁来帮帮我 加油 宝贝
Let's get out of here. Anybody, please help me. Come on, baby.

572
01:02:18.320 --> 01:02:20.874
搞定了 准备好了没？走 走 走！
We got this. Ready? Go, go, go!

573
01:02:22.186 --> 01:02:28.399
搞定了 一 二 三 拉！爸爸 科拉 使劲拉！
We got this. One, two, three. Pull! Daddy, Cora, pull!

574
01:02:28.537 --> 01:02:31.436
把这个放到木筏上 别松手 爸爸 科拉
Get this onto a raft, don't drop it. Daddy, Cora.

575
01:02:31.575 --> 01:02:33.643
快离开这儿 爸爸 对不起
Let's get out of here. Daddy, I'm sorry.

576
01:02:34.785 --> 01:02:36.851
科拉 科拉 快走 对不起
Cora, Cora, come on. I'm sorry.

577
01:02:38.824 --> 01:02:42.310
离那儿远点 不 老兄 你干嘛呢？怎么打不开？
Get away from there. No, man, what are you doing? Why didn't it open?

578
01:02:42.448 --> 01:02:44.104
不知道 拉那破绳子
I don't know. Pull the goddamn rope.

579
01:03:32.222 --> 01:03:33.154
快点 快点
Come on, come on.

580
01:03:36.122 --> 01:03:37.020
快点
Come on.

581
01:04:04.737 --> 01:04:05.297
喂
Hey.

582
01:04:06.557 --> 01:04:07.325
这儿
Here.

583
01:04:09.684 --> 01:04:13.264
应急定位发射器 什么？那个定位器
The ELT. What? The locator.

584
01:04:13.264 --> 01:04:14.993
我给你的那个盒子呢？在哪？
That box I gave you. Where is it?

585
01:04:21.106 --> 01:04:22.098
你逗我呢吧
You gotta be kidding me.

586
01:04:23.453 --> 01:04:24.925
别这样 老兄 我还指望你呢
Come on, man. I was counting on you.

587
01:04:25.068 --> 01:04:26.509
你只要把它带上救生筏就行
All you had to do was get it on the raft.

588
01:04:26.655 --> 01:04:31.242
行吧 既然这么重要 你倒是自己看着办啊 定位器？他说的什么玩意儿？
Yeah, well, if it was so important, maybe you should've looked after it. Locator? What's he talking about?

589
01:04:31.384 --> 01:04:34.798
那是他们找到我们的关键吧？结果你给弄丢了
Is that what they need to find us? And you lost it.

590
01:04:34.940 --> 01:04:41.462
喂 别赖我 老兄 这是你的责任 机长 喂！那边！喂！
Hey, don't put this on me, man. This was your responsibility, Captain. Hey! Over there! Hey!

591
01:04:42.602 --> 01:04:44.292
这儿 你看见他们了吗？
Here, do you see them?

592
01:04:45.222 --> 01:04:47.227
想想办法啊 没戏
Please do something. No way.

593
01:04:47.366 --> 01:04:49.293
不行 他们可以游到另一个筏子那儿
No, they can swim to the other raft.

594
01:04:49.437 --> 01:04:51.157
水流太急了 他们根本过不去
The current is too strong. They'll never make it.

595
01:04:51.301 --> 01:04:53.919
你没看见我们船里都进水了吗？
Can't you see we're already taking on water?

596
01:05:05.625 --> 01:05:08.454
哇！怎么了？怎么了？
Whoa! What? What?

597
01:05:09.284 --> 01:05:10.457
天哪
Oh my God.

598
01:05:13.677 --> 01:05:19.811
你凭什么做决定？我才是机长 那是我的飞机 哦 那架飞机
Who the hell are you to decide? I'm the captain. It's my plane. Oh, that plane.

599
01:05:20.468 --> 01:05:24.021
干得漂亮 是吧？都是因为你 人死了
Great job, huh? People are dead because of you.

600
01:05:24.260 --> 01:05:30.131
现在你想拿我们的命去冒险 就为了让自己好受点？做梦吧 我们原地不动
And now you want to risk our lives to make yourself feel better? No way. We stay put.

601
01:05:42.706 --> 01:05:44.532
你还敢说自己是机长？
You call yourself a captain, huh?

602
01:05:45.902 --> 01:05:47.798
你连救生筏都开不了
You can't even pilot a raft.

603
01:05:50.808 --> 01:05:52.254
我们必须去救他们
We're going to get them.

604
01:05:52.792 --> 01:05:58.174
你心里明白 如果我们不去 那两个小子会有什么结局 把筏子解开
You know damn well what will happen to those two young men if we don't. Untether these rafts.

605
01:06:03.166 --> 01:06:04.304
不行！喂！
No! Hey!

606
01:06:06.043 --> 01:06:11.220
他打我！你看到了 闭嘴 贱人
He hit me! You're a witness. Shut up, bitch.

607
01:06:12.430 --> 01:06:15.772
听见这位女士说的了 别晃船了 出发
You heard the lady. And stop rocking the raft. Let's go.

608
01:06:25.153 --> 01:06:28.645
我想离开 我们还得在这儿待多久？
I want to go. How much longer do we have to stay here?

609
01:06:29.295 --> 01:06:31.464
但愿马特没跟美人鱼跑了吧
I hope Matt hasn't swum away with a mermaid.

610
01:06:33.299 --> 01:06:34.435
他不会丢下我们的
He wouldn't leave us.

611
01:06:56.115 --> 01:06:57.219
它在等什么？
What's it waiting for?

612
01:06:59.256 --> 01:07:00.428
它在等什么？
What's it waiting for?

613
01:07:17.102 --> 01:07:18.206
我们快离开这儿
Let's get out of here.

614
01:07:20.174 --> 01:07:22.274
把手给我 快
Give me your hand. Come on.

615
01:07:25.524 --> 01:07:26.490
加油
Come on.

616
01:07:28.354 --> 01:07:30.424
加油 快 加油
Come on, come on, come on.

617
01:07:39.848 --> 01:07:40.918
又是你们两个啊？
You two again, huh?

618
01:07:45.544 --> 01:07:47.787
好了 我们撤吧 走
All right, let's get out of here. Let's go.

619
01:07:53.483 --> 01:07:57.302
出飞机后 我们将救生衣充气
When we get outside the plane, we inflate our jackets.

620
01:07:57.694 --> 01:08:01.459
像大气球一样 直接浮到水面上 不
They'll take us straight up to the surface like a big balloon. No.

621
01:08:01.459 --> 01:08:04.439
我还需要点时间 你不能留在这儿
I need a little more time. You can't stay here.

622
01:08:04.794 --> 01:08:09.325
我带不了你们俩 你能行的 整天忙这忙那的
I can't take both of you. You can do it. Doing this, doing that.

623
01:08:09.464 --> 01:08:12.044
我总是一直在忙
I'm always trying to keep doing.

624
01:08:12.329 --> 01:08:16.503
自从比尔走后 就觉得没意思了 你懂的
Ever since Bill died, it just gets old, you know.

625
01:08:16.644 --> 01:08:18.093
贝基 对不起
Becky, I'm sorry I am.

626
01:08:18.093 --> 01:08:23.487
但我们必须走了 不 我知道 你带芬恩走 不 你也来 求你了
But we have to go now. No, I know. You take Finn. No, you come too. Please.

627
01:08:23.532 --> 01:08:29.064
你坚强点 高手 我欣赏你的范儿 别管我
You stay strong, hotshot. I admire your style. Don't worry about me.

628
01:08:33.595 --> 01:08:36.248
我会回来的 贝基 我发誓
I will come back, Becky. I promise.

629
01:08:37.673 --> 01:08:39.293
你没事吧？嗯
You okay? Yeah.

630
01:08:40.209 --> 01:08:41.324
乖孩子
Good boy.

631
01:09:47.976 --> 01:09:49.143
马特
Matt.

632
01:09:57.067 --> 01:09:58.307
我们能行
We can make it.

633
01:09:59.540 --> 01:10:04.887
所以 机长 你有没有一个不单靠运气的计划？
So, Captain, do you have a plan that doesn't rely on just dumb luck?

634
01:10:05.960 --> 01:10:06.994
你知道我们都还活着
You know we're alive.

635
01:10:08.074 --> 01:10:09.489
我们都还活着
We're all alive.

636
01:10:12.932 --> 01:10:13.967
你有孩子吗？
You got kids?

637
01:10:18.594 --> 01:10:19.318
有
Yeah.

638
01:10:20.354 --> 01:10:27.254
我女儿泰瑞 小儿子肖恩 哦 我有三个孩子
My daughter Terri, my little boy Sean. Well, I got three.

639
01:10:28.431 --> 01:10:29.879
最小的才五岁
Youngest is five.

640
01:10:31.399 --> 01:10:33.674
我告诉你 他们长大不能没有我
I can tell you they ain't growing up without me.

641
01:10:35.196 --> 01:10:40.752
所以 不管你做什么  来让自己对牺牲那么多人好受点
So whatever you gotta do to make yourself feel better about losing all those people back there,

642
01:10:41.941 --> 01:10:43.372
但别拿我当借口 朋友
but don't use me, pal.

643
01:10:45.241 --> 01:10:48.934
因为无论如何  我都要活着回家
Because I'm going home whatever it takes

644
01:10:51.281 --> 01:10:56.453
是啊 我敢肯定你的孩子会为你感到骄傲 难怪你还是单身
Yeah, I am sure your kids are real proud of you. No wonder you're single

645
